    "what": "Presentation DEFAULTS (family + icon + family colours) per element type. Defaults, not authority \u2014 tools may override, and Atlas remaps wholesale for dark mode.",
    "public": "Per type, the fields the OnlyWorlds platform shows on a 'known of' element (one a reader knows of but does not see whole) beside its name, description, supertype, subtype and picture. Platform behaviour, not a default to override; an empty list means those base fields only.",
